-| The three interface tasks run at once, but qserver's and explorer's stubs import qdata's types and the generated schema | Their import checks fail until the other interface task merges | Each interface task's import check runs at merge; the orchestrator merges M1-T01 first |
+| M1-T01 and M1-T02 run at once, but qserver's stubs import qdata's types | Its import checks fail until M1-T01 merges | Each interface task's import check runs at merge; the orchestrator merges M1-T01 first |
